{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101603","id":2279924054,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6H5OFW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101603","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101603.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101603.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101603","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101603/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101603/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101603/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1f333d21f958ee88b3e2dc146f9b1eff04ca06c3","number":101603,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Nest `.uid` file in `.cs` file for Visual Studio","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Partially address https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11565\r\n\r\nAdd an ItemGroup to default csproj to make `.uid` files included in VS solutions.\r\n\r\ncsproj file now looks like:\r\n```csproj\r\n<Project Sdk=\"Godot.NET.Sdk/4.4.0-beta\">\r\n  <PropertyGroup>\r\n    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>\r\n    <EnableDynamicLoading>true</EnableDynamicLoading>\r\n  </PropertyGroup>\r\n  <ItemGroup>\r\n    <None Include=\"**\\*.uid\" />\r\n  </ItemGroup>\r\n</Project>\r\n```\r\n\r\nUser need to further choose file nesting setting \"Web\" for `.uid` files to be hidden and follow `.cs` files. This needs to be documented. Unfortunately my English is not good so I need some help in this part. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-15T19:19:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T10:34:55Z","closed_at"